<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Fairwood shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Fairwood shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Fairwood Holdings Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Fairwood shares eased HK$0.01 to HK$0.435 on Tuesday. Turnover was 4.89 million shares worth HK$2.16 million.</p>
<p>Fairwood is a fast food chain.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
